                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game needs a TON of work to be worth $20. In the current state it doesnt even compete with the other VR multiplayer shooters in the same price range. Mechanics are unresponsive at times and will often not even work, the repeating sound effects will drive you insane, too many bugs that make playing a match not even worth playing, sorely needs optimization. I don't think it should have came out of the testing phase. It has some potential but it needs much MUCH more work. The positive reviews are mostly from testers who are friends with the devs. I like the devs too but the game is not worth the $20 right now.",
